sequenceDiagram
  participant L as SQLite log
  participant P as Pi 5 uploader
  participant S as Server API
  participant D as Database
  participant W as Dashboard
  P->>L: read unsent events
  L-->>P: event rows with tier and escalated flag, no video
  P->>S: POST events over TLS with device key
  Note right of S: check key and event IDs
  S->>D: insert, skip duplicates
  D-->>S: stored
  S-->>P: accepted IDs
  P->>L: mark rows as uploaded
  D->>W: refresh trends and tips
  Note over L,P: No connection: retry after 30, 60 and 120 s
